
# Docker Image Optimization — Review Report

## 1. Purpose

This document defines how the AI Product Manager will review and compare the baseline (fat) and optimized (slim) Docker images.

The goal is to determine whether optimization improves deployment efficiency without affecting model functionality, reliability, or security.

